msgid ""
"Specify or disable annotated contour levels, modifies annotated contours "
"specified in ``levels``.  - Specify a fixed annotation interval. - Specify a "
"list of annotation levels. - Disable all annotations by setting "
"``annotation=\"n\"``. - Adjust the appearance by appending different "
"modifiers, e.g.,   ``\"annot_int+f10p+gred\"`` gives annotations with a font "
"size of 10 points and   a red filled box. For all available modifiers see :"
"gmt-docs:`contour.html#a`."
